+-- hit cost one). A What's Left report asks for the same few hundred ids
+-- thousands of times (5,204 calls in the harness), so decoded lists are
+-- memoized here as read-only shared arrays - like the old static table, but
+-- only for the ids a report reaches; misses (raw materials) memoize as false.
+-- Wiped when it outgrows STATIC_RG_MAX entries (~110 KB of hash on the 32-bit
+-- client), well below the old always-resident table.
+local staticRg, staticRgN = {}, 0
+local STATIC_RG_MAX = 4096
